{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Rehovot</b> — corresponding to Greece (Yavan), who decreed that they may not immerse, in order to prevent them from being fruitful and multiplying. A miracle was performed for them and a ritual bath was available to each and every one — this is \"and we shall be fruitful in the land.\""], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:04.408641846Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}